# Working before/after screenshots for in-progress review, 2026-08-24 --
# ephemeral, overwritten freely, never part of history. Keep README.md
# tracked so the folder still explains itself. Curated/kept images belong
# in landing-v3/dev-screenshots/ instead (not gitignored -- that one's
# permanent). (2026-08-29: corrected the folder name here -- previously
# said "dev-archive/", which never actually existed.)
review/*
